{"title":"🎃  Halloween Dinner @ The Haunted Keg Mansion 👻","startsAt":"2026-10-31T18:45:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T21:45:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"# 🎃 **Halloween Dinner @ The Haunted Keg Mansion 👻**\n\nThis year marks our **14th annual Halloween Dinner at The Keg Mansion** — a tradition I started with this group fourteen years ago.\n\n⚠️ **This event fills up every year, and spots are limited to just 30 people. If you want to join us, please make sure you’re committed before signing up.**\n\nIf you don’t already know, The Keg Mansion is one of the most haunted buildings in Toronto. Some guests claim to have seen the Lady in the window upstairs, and the women’s washroom is famous for its ghostly encounters. We may not know exactly where we’ll be seated, but the second floor is known to be especially active… if you dare. 👻\n\n📱 Don't forget to join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n***\n\n## 🍽️ The Keg Mansion\n\nThe Keg is a classic steakhouse with a wide range of dishes and price points, so there’s something for everyone. Whether you’re coming for the meal, the company, or the possibility of encountering something from the other side, you’ll be part of one of our longest-running Halloween traditions.\n\n📋 **Menu:**[ Click Here](https://thekeg.com/en/locations/mansion/menu)\n💲 **Cost of Meal:** $$$\n\n***\n\n## 👥 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Spot:** I’ll be waiting outside The Keg Mansion wearing my Moose Hat. Please don’t go inside without me.\n🕖 **Meetup Time:** 6:45 pm\n\n**I’ll only wait 5 minutes!**\n\n***\n\n## 🎭 Dress Code & Church Street\n\nEvery year people ask if they can dress up — the answer is **YES!** Costumes are welcome. 🎃\nAfter dinner, anyone who wants to head to **Church Street for Toronto’s famous Halloween Festival** is welcome to go.\n\nIt gets **very crowded**, so I won’t be joining the group or leading everyone through the festival. I’ll help anyone who wants to go together find one another, point you in the right direction, and make sure you know where you’re headed.\nFrom there, you’re on your own to enjoy the madness! 👻\n\n***\n\n## 💵 SAVE YOUR SPOT — PLEASE READ BEFORE RSVPing\n\n**Spots are limited to 24 people.**\n\nTo secure your spot, a **$25 e-transfer must be sent to [mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com) within 24 hours of signing up.**\nThis applies to **everyone**.\n\nIt does not matter whether you joined the group yesterday, have been here for fourteen years, or have been a member in good standing for years. **If you are attending this event, you pay the $25 save-your-spot fee. There are no exceptions.**\n\nHere’s how it works:\n\n* **$25 must be paid within 24 hours of signing up.**\n* **$20 will be returned to you when you show up.**\n* **$5 is the Meetup fee that supports the group.**\n* If payment is not received within 24 hours, **your spot may be given to someone else.**\n* **There are no refunds for any reason.**\n\nPlease do not sign up unless you are **100% committed to attending**. With only 30 spots available, every spot matters.\nI’m not going to chase people for payment. If you sign up, you are responsible for sending the $25 within the 24-hour deadline.\n\n⚠️ **Waiting List:** If the event is full and you are placed on the waiting list, **do not send the $25 e-transfer.** Only send payment if I contact you and confirm that a spot has become available. Your spot is not confirmed until I have contacted you and confirmed it.\n\n***\n\n## ⚠️ Important Notes\n\n* Sometimes things happen and I may need to cancel — please watch for updates.\n* Please **don’t call the restaurant** — they won’t know anything about this event. Direct all questions to me.\n* This group is open to everyone: singles, couples, and anyone looking to be social, make friends, and have fun. We also host movies, walks, hikes, arts & culture outings, and more!\n\n👤 **Organized by Mathew.** For questions, post on the wall or email **[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)**","venue":{"name":"THE KEG MANSION","address":"515 Jarvis Street, Toronto","lat":43.66684,"lng":-79.37794,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":{"amount":5,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/6/highres_475080022.jpeg"}